diff --git a/features/todos.feature b/features/todos.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..a63e3ed
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todos.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,120 @@
+Feature: Todo management
+  As a user
+  I want to create, complete, edit, and delete todos
+  So that I can track my tasks
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+    And there are no todos
+
+  Rule: Creating todos
+
+  Scenario: Creating a new todo appends it to the list
+    When I type "Buy milk" into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then I see 1 todo in the list
+    And the new-todo input is cleared
+    And the todo label reads "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Creating a todo with only whitespace is ignored
+    When I type "   " into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then I see 0 todos in the list
+
+  Scenario: Creating multiple todos shows them in order
+    When I type "First" into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    And I type "Second" into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    And I type "Third" into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then the todo list contains "First", "Second", "Third" in that order
+
+  Rule: Toggling completion
+
+  Scenario: Completing a todo marks it as completed
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I click the toggle checkbox for that todo
+    Then the todo has class "completed"
+
+  Scenario: Completing all todos checks the mark-all checkbox
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    And I have a todo "Walk dog"
+    When I complete all todos
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: The mark-all checkbox toggles all todos
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk", "Walk dog", "Read book"
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then all 3 todos are completed
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox again
+    Then 0 todos are completed
+
+  Rule: Editing todos
+
+  Scenario: Double-clicking a todo activates edit mode
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I double-click the todo label
+    Then the todo has class "editing"
+    And the edit input is focused
+
+  Scenario: Saving an edit by pressing Enter
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I double-click the todo label
+    And I change the edit value to "Buy organic milk" and press Enter
+    Then the todo label reads "Buy organic milk"
+    And the todo does not have class "editing"
+
+  Scenario: Saving an edit on blur
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I double-click the todo label
+    And I change the edit value to "Buy cream" and blur
+    Then the todo label reads "Buy cream"
+
+  Scenario: Clearing the title during edit destroys the todo
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I double-click the todo label
+    And I clear the edit value and press Enter
+    Then I see 0 todos in the list
+
+  Scenario: Pressing Escape during edit discards changes
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I double-click the todo label
+    And I change the edit value to "Buy organic milk" and press Escape
+    Then the todo label reads "Buy milk"
+    And the todo does not have class "editing"
+
+  Rule: Deleting and clearing
+
+  Scenario: Deleting a single todo removes it from the list
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I click the destroy button for that todo
+    Then I see 0 todos in the list
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes only completed todos
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk", "Walk dog", "Read book"
+    And "Buy milk" is completed
+    When I click "Clear completed"
+    Then I see 2 todos in the list
+    And the remaining todos are "Walk dog" and "Read book"
+
+  Rule: Counter
+
+  Scenario: Counter displays the number of active todos
+    Given I have todos "Buy milk", "Walk dog", "Read book"
+    Then the todo-count reads "3 items left"
+    When I complete "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo-count reads "2 items left"
+    When I complete "Walk dog" and "Read book"
+    Then the todo-count reads "0 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter uses singular for one active todo
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo-count reads "1 item left"
+
+  Rule: Empty state
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are hidden when no todos exist
+    Given there are no todos
+    Then the main section is hidden
+    And the footer is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer appear when todos exist
+    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the main section is visible
+    And the footer is visible
